<title>CANADA: Tarxien Sept 30 9 mth net turns to profit.</title>
<headline>Tarxien Sept 30 9 mth net turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$0.92     loss	C$1.22</p>
<p> Net	 profit	 2,851     loss	 3,604</p>
<p> Revs			45,944		   30,527</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
